@startuml
title Expense Submission, Approval, and Balance Effect

|Group Member|
start
:Enter expense, payer, participants,\nsplit method and optional receipt;

|Domain Rules|
:Validate positive amount and currency scale;
:Validate percentage total and allocate\nminor-unit remainders deterministically;
if (Input valid?) then (yes)
  :Create Pending expense;
  fork
    |Notifications|
    :Notify other group members\nof expense creation;
  fork again
    |Approver|
    :Review expense under group policy;
  end fork
  if (Decision is rejection?) then (yes)
    |Domain Rules|
    :Mark Rejected;
    :Leave balances unchanged;
  else (no)
    if (All required approvals complete?) then (yes)
      |Domain Rules|
      :Mark Approved;
      :Apply payer credit and participant shares;
      :Recompute pairwise balances;
    else (pending)
      |Domain Rules|
      :Keep Pending;
      :Leave balances unchanged;
    endif
  endif
else (no)
  |Group Member|
  :Show validation error;\nDo not submit expense;
endif
stop
@enduml
